            <ArticleTitle>One-step detection of microRNA with high sensitivity and specificity via target-triggered loop-mediated isothermal amplification (TT-LAMP).</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>11040-11043</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1039/c7cc06140d</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A novel one-step microRNA assay is developed based on a target-triggered loop-mediated isothermal amplification (TT-LAMP) mechanism, which enables the accurate detection of as low as 100 aM (1 zmol) microRNA with simple one-step operation by using only one-type of DNA polymerase.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
